"**Webbplats:** [https://www.torproject.org](https://www.torproject.org)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- \"Start on boot\" preference"
msgstr "- Inställningen ”Starta vid systemstart”"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- **Add-ons and extensions**: Users may install additional extensions in Tor "
"Browser. These extensions might independently fetch updates or blocklists "
"(e.g., uBlock Origin downloads filter lists). All such requests are routed "
"through the Tor network to preserve anonymity."
msgstr ""
"- **Tillägg och tillägg**: Användare kan installera ytterligare tillägg i "
"Tor Browser. Dessa tillägg kan hämta uppdateringar eller blocklistor "
"oberoende av varandra (t.ex. uBlock Origins hämtningsfilterlistor). Alla "
"sådana förfrågningar dirigeras via Tor-nätverket för att bevara anonymiteten."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- **Bookmarks and downloads** created by users are saved to the local device "
"and are not deleted automatically."
msgstr ""
"- **Bokmärken och hämtningar** som skapas av användare sparas på den lokala "
"enheten och raderas inte automatiskt."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- **Local browser preferences and configuration data** such as settings, "
"saved passwords, site exceptions, search engine selections, preferences for "
"showing dialogs, and other locally stored user-configured information."
msgstr ""
"- **Lokala webbläsarinställningar och konfigurationsdata**, till exempel "
"inställningar, sparade lösenord, webbplatsundantag, val av sökmotor, "
"inställningar för visning av dialogrutor och annan lokalt lagrad information "
"som användaren har konfigurerat."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- **Local-only** session logs, visible in the Logs view, are discarded after "
"the VPN is stopped and the app is quit"
msgstr ""
"- **Lokala** sessionsloggar, som visas i loggvyn, tas bort när VPN-"
"anslutningen stoppas och appen avslutas"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- **Local-only** session stats (duration, bandwidth), discarded after session"
msgstr ""
"- **Lokal** sessionsstatistik (varaktighet och bandbredd), som tas bort "
"efter sessionen"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- **Never transmitted** to The Tor Project or any third party"
msgstr "- Överförs **aldrig** till The Tor Project eller någon tredje part"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- **No collection of personal or sensitive user data**"
msgstr "- **Ingen insamling av personliga eller känsliga användaruppgifter**"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- **No persistent personal data is collected or transmitted by Tor Browser**"
msgstr ""
"- **Inga permanenta personuppgifter samlas in eller överförs av Tor Browser**"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- **No remote telemetry or usage logging**"
msgstr "- **Ingen fjärrtelemetri eller loggning av användning**"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- **No syncing or cloud backups** of user activity, configuration, or "
"identity are performed."
msgstr ""
"- **Ingen synkronisering eller molnsäkerhetskopior** av användaraktivitet, "
"konfiguration eller identitet utförs."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- **No tracking, telemetry, or analytics**"
msgstr "- **Ingen spårning, telemetri eller analys**"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- **No user accounts or identity linkage**"
msgstr "- **Inga användarkonton eller identitetskoppling**"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- **No user data is shared** with third parties — no advertisers, analytics "
"providers, or others."
msgstr ""
"- **Ingen användardata delas** med tredje part – inga annonsörer, "
"analysleverantörer eller andra."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- **No user sign-in, tracking, or identity linkage**"
msgstr "- **Ingen användarinloggning, spårning eller koppling till identitet**"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- **No** access to contacts, files, or personal identifiers"
msgstr ""
"- **Ingen** åtkomst till kontakter, filer eller personliga identifierare"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- **Not linked to identity** or device information"
msgstr "- **Kopplas inte till identitet** eller enhetsinformation"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- **Private Browsing Mode (PBM)** behavior:"
msgstr "- **Beteende i privat surfläge (PBM)**:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- **Session Data** (e.g. tabs, site data, cookies, history) is erased when "
"the app is closed (Android), or the user choses \"New Identity\" or closes "
"the browser (Desktop with PBM enabled)"
msgstr ""
"- **Sessionsdata** (t.ex. flikar, webbplatsdata, cookies, historik) raderas "
"när appen stängs (Android), eller när användaren väljer \"Ny identitet\" "
"eller stänger webbläsaren (skrivbord med PBM aktiverat)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- **Temporary session cache only** by default, cleared on exit or \"New "
"Identity\""
msgstr ""
"- Som standard används **endast en tillfällig sessionscache**, som rensas "
"vid avslut eller när ”Ny identitet” används"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- **Tor Browser for Android**"
msgstr "- **Tor Browser för Android**"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- **Tor Browser for Desktop**"
msgstr "- **Tor Browser för skrivbordet**"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- **Tor State** files necessary for Tor network connectivity (such as guard "
"nodes and consensus info). This data is non-identifying and used only for "
"Tor functionality."
msgstr ""
"- **Tor-status**-filer som är nödvändiga för Tor-nätverksanslutning (såsom "
"skyddsnoder och konsensusinformation). Denna data är icke-identifierande och "
"används endast för Tor-funktionalitet."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- **Tor VPN**"
msgstr "- **Tor VPN**"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- All connections routed through the Tor network for anonymity, with **one "
"exception:**"
msgstr ""
"- Alla anslutningar dirigeras via Tor-nätverket för anonymitet, med **ett "
"undantag:**"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- All traffic is encrypted and routed through Tor"
msgstr "- All trafik är krypterad och dirigeras via Tor"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Allowing site-specific functionality (e.g., video conferencing)"
msgstr "- Tillåta platsspecifik funktionalitet (t.ex. videokonferenser)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Are stored **only on the user's device**"
msgstr "- Lagras **endast på användarens enhet**"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Are used **solely** for local functionality and configuration"
msgstr "- Används **uteslutande** för lokal funktionalitet och konfigurering"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Camera, microphone, or sensors"
msgstr "- Kamera, mikrofon eller sensorer"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- Can be deleted at **any time** via in-app settings or by uninstalling the "
"app"
msgstr ""
"- Kan tas bort **när som helst** via appens inställningar eller genom att "
"appen avinstalleras"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- Check for software updates from Tor Project servers, over the Tor network"
msgstr ""
"- Sök efter programuppdateringar från Tor Project-servrar, över Tor-nätverket"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Code is open for public audit"
msgstr "- Koden är öppen för offentlig granskning"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Contacts"
msgstr "- Kontakter"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Device identifiers (e.g. IMEI, Android ID)"
msgstr "- Enhetsidentifierare (t.ex. IMEI eller Android-ID)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Device identifiers (e.g., IMEI, Android ID)"
msgstr "- Enhetsidentifierare (t.ex. IMEI, Android-ID)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- Does **not collect IP addresses, browsing history, device IDs, or "
"location**"
msgstr ""
"- **Samlar inte in IP-adresser, webbhistorik, enhets-ID:n eller plats**"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Exit node preferences (e.g., country selection)"
msgstr "- Inställningar för utgångsrelä (t.ex. val av land)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- External storage or files"
msgstr "- Extern lagring eller filer"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- Fetch extension updates from Mozilla’s Add-ons service (e.g., for bundled "
"extensions like NoScript)"
msgstr ""
"- Hämta tilläggsuppdateringar från Mozillas tilläggstjänst (t.ex. för "
"paketerade tillägg som NoScript)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- For **Android apps**, updates are delivered via app distribution platforms "
"(e.g., Google Play) and not directly from Tor Project servers."
msgstr ""
"- För **Android-appar** levereras uppdateringar via "
"appdistributionsplattformar (t.ex. Google Play) och inte direkt från Tor "
"Project-servrar."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- For **Tor Browser on Desktop**, the application may **anonymously** check "
"for available software updates from Tor Project servers. These update checks:"
msgstr ""
"- För **Tor Browser på skrivbordet** kan programmet **anonymt** söka efter "
"tillgängliga programuppdateringar från Tor Project-servrar. Dessa "
"uppdateringskontroller:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- In **Tor Browser for Desktop**, users may manually choose to visit https://"
"check.torproject.org via a link in the Tor Browser home page (about:tor) to "
"verify their connection. This is optional, user-initiated, and routed over "
"Tor. No identifying information is logged or stored. This check is not "
"performed automatically and is not present on **Android**."
msgstr ""
"- I **Tor Browser för datorer** kan användare själva välja att besöka "
"https://check.torproject.org via en länk på Tor Browsers startsida "
"(about:tor) för att kontrollera anslutningen. Detta är valfritt, initieras "
"av användaren och dirigeras via Tor. Ingen identifierande information loggas "
"eller lagras. Kontrollen görs inte automatiskt och finns inte på **Android**."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- In environments with restricted or censored internet access, Tor Browser "
"may use anti-censorship tools such as pluggable transports (PTs) (e.g., "
"Moat) to obtain bridge information."
msgstr ""
"- I miljöer med begränsad eller censurerad internetåtkomst kan Tor Browser "
"använda anticensurverktyg som pluggbara transporter (PT) (t.ex. Moat) för "
"att hämta brygginformation."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- In those cases, when we distribute our applications through Google Play "
"services, our hands are tied and [their terms and policies](https://"
"play.google.com/about/play-terms.html) apply. If you wish to obtain Tor VPN "
"from a no-logging, non-tracking, free and open-source app store, then use F-"
"Droid to do so."
msgstr ""
"- När vi distribuerar våra appar via Google Play-tjänster är våra "
"möjligheter begränsade och [Googles villkor och policyer](https://"
"play.google.com/about/play-terms.html) gäller. Hämta Tor VPN från F-Droid om "
"du föredrar en kostnadsfri appbutik med öppen källkod som inte loggar eller "
"spårar användare."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Isolation of website content"
msgstr "- Isolering av webbplatsinnehåll"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- List of installed apps (used locally to manage per-app routing)"
msgstr ""
"- Lista över installerade appar (används lokalt för att hantera dirigering "
"per app)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- List of protected apps (required to enforce traffic routing exceptions)"
msgstr ""
"- Lista över skyddade appar (krävs för att tillämpa undantag från "
"trafikdirigeringen)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Location"
msgstr "- Plats"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- On **Android**, PBM is always-on, and prevents local storage of history, "
"cookies, or session data."
msgstr ""
"- På **Android** är privat surfläge alltid aktiverat och förhindrar lokal "
"lagring av historik, kakor och sessionsdata."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- On **Desktop**, PBM is enabled by default, but can be disabled in browser "
"settings. In this case, data such as browsing history, cookies, and cached "
"site data may persist across sessions unless cleared manually."
msgstr ""
"- På **datorer** är privat surfläge aktiverat som standard, men kan "
"inaktiveras i webbläsarens inställningar. Då kan data som webbhistorik, "
"kakor och cachelagrade webbplatsdata finnas kvar mellan sessioner om de inte "
"rensas manuellt."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Open-source and privacy-by-design"
msgstr "- Öppen källkod och integritet genom design"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- Per-app routing rules (which apps should or should not be routed over Tor)"
msgstr ""
"- Regler för dirigering per app (vilka appar som ska eller inte ska "
"dirigeras via Tor)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Phone call logs or SMS data"
msgstr "- Samtalsloggar eller SMS-data från telefon"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Preferred manual launcher (if any)"
msgstr "- Föredragen manuell startapp, om någon"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Publishing an updated policy on this page"
msgstr "- Publicera en uppdaterad policy på den här sidan"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Scanning QR codes using the URL bar"
msgstr "- Skanna QR-koder med hjälp av URL-fältet"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Screen size normalization (**Desktop only**)"
msgstr "- Normalisering av skärmstorlek (**Endast skrivbord**)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Selected bridge relays or custom bridge configurations"
msgstr "- Valda broreläer eller anpassade brokonfigurationer"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- The Tor Project does not log any personally identifiable information "
"during these signaling requests."
msgstr ""
"- Tor Project loggar ingen personligt identifierbar information under dessa "
"signaleringsförfrågningar."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- These tools require **brief non-Tor** connections, known as signaling "
"channels, to fetch data necessary to connect to the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"- Dessa verktyg kräver **kortvariga anslutningar utanför Tor**, så kallade "
"signaleringskanaler, för att hämta de uppgifter som behövs för att ansluta "
"till Tor-nätverket."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- These update requests are not linked to user identity or device "
"information."
msgstr ""
"- Dessa uppdateringsförfrågningar är inte kopplade till användaridentitet "
"eller enhetsinformation."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- This may occur automatically, or it may be triggered by a user action."
msgstr "- Detta kan ske automatiskt eller utlösas av en användaråtgärd."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- Tor Browser for Desktop and Android includes built-in defenses against "
"tracking and fingerprinting, such as:"
msgstr ""
"- Tor Browser för skrivbordet och Android har inbyggda skydd mot spårning "
"och fingeravtryck, till exempel:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- Tor VPN is designed to isolate traffic so there is a different Tor circuit "
"used per app"
msgstr ""
"- Tor VPN är utformat för att isolera trafiken så att varje app använder en "
"egen Tor-krets"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Uniform user-agent strings"
msgstr "- Enhetliga användaragentsträngar"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- Updating the \"Effective Date\""
msgstr "- Uppdatering av \"Ikraftträdandedatum\""

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- User accounts or login credentials"
msgstr "- Användarkonton eller inloggningsuppgifter"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- `ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE / ACCESS_WIFI_STATE` — to detect network "
"availability and changes"
msgstr ""
"- `ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE / ACCESS_WIFI_STATE` — för att identifiera "
"nätverkstillgänglighet och nätverksförändringar"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- `BIND_VPN_SERVICE` — to create and maintain secure VPN connections"
msgstr ""
"- `BIND_VPN_SERVICE` — för att skapa och upprätthålla säkra VPN-anslutningar"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- `FOREGROUND_SERVICE / FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SYSTEM_EXEMPTED` — to comply with "
"modern Android requirements for long-running VPN services"
msgstr ""
"- `FOREGROUND_SERVICE / FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SYSTEM_EXEMPTED` — för att "
"uppfylla moderna Android-krav på långvariga VPN-tjänster"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- `HIGH_SAMPLING_RATE_SENSORS` — used for certain JavaScript APIs; timing is "
"throttled by Tor Browser’s privacy protections"
msgstr ""
"- `HIGH_SAMPLING_RATE_SENSORS` — används för vissa JavaScript API:er; "
"tidtagningen begränsas av Tor Browsers integritetsskydd"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- `INTERNET` — to connect to the Tor network"
msgstr "- `INTERNET` — för att ansluta till Tor-nätverket"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- `INTERNET` — to connect to the Tor network and route traffic"
msgstr "- `INTERNET` — för att ansluta till Tor-nätverket och dirigera trafik"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- `MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS` — required by WebRTC-related components (note: "
"WebRTC is permanently disabled at build time)"
msgstr ""
"- `MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS` — krävs av WebRTC-relaterade komponenter (obs: "
"WebRTC är permanent inaktiverat vid byggtid)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- `POST_NOTIFICATIONS` — used for connection status notifications when "
"enabled (Android 13+)"
msgstr ""
"- `POST_NOTIFICATIONS` — används för aviseringar om anslutningsstatus när de "
"är aktiverade (Android 13 eller senare)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- `QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES` — used locally to display a list of installed apps "
"for per-app routing settings (never transmitted or logged)"
msgstr ""
"- `QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES` — används lokalt för att visa en lista över "
"installerade appar i inställningarna för dirigering per app (överförs eller "
"loggas aldrig)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- `RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED` — to optionally start Tor VPN on device boot (if "
"the user enables “Start on boot”)"
msgstr ""
"- `RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED` — för att valfritt starta Tor VPN när enheten "
"startas (om användaren aktiverar ”Starta vid systemstart”)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- `VIBRATE` — used only for optional in-app notifications (e.g., connection "
"status)"
msgstr ""
"- `VIBRATE` — används endast för valfria aviseringar i appen (t.ex. om "
"anslutningsstatus)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "- `WAKE_LOCK` — prevents the device from sleeping during active VPN use"
msgstr ""
"- `WAKE_LOCK` — förhindrar att enheten försätts i viloläge medan VPN-"
"anslutningen används"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"- `WAKE_LOCK` — prevents the device from sleeping during active use (e.g., "
"video playback)"
msgstr ""
"- `WAKE_LOCK` — förhindrar att enheten försätts i viloläge under aktiv "
"användning (t.ex. videouppspelning)"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"Access to camera, microphone, or device sensors is not requested by default."
msgstr ""
"Åtkomst till kamera, mikrofon eller enhetssensorer begärs inte som standard."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"All permissions are either essential for VPN functionality or provide local-"
"only features controlled by the user."
msgstr ""
"Alla behörigheter är antingen nödvändiga för VPN-funktionen eller möjliggör "
"lokala funktioner som användaren styr."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"All such requests are subject to Android’s runtime permission model, users "
"are in control of granting or denying said access, and is limited in scope "
"and duration."
msgstr ""
"Alla sådana förfrågningar omfattas av Androids modell för "
"körtidsbehörigheter. Användaren bestämmer om åtkomsten ska beviljas eller "
"nekas, och åtkomsten är begränsad i både omfattning och varaktighet."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"Because Tor Browser for Desktop and Android do not collect, process, or "
"store personal data — by design and in practice — the GDPR does not apply to "
"these applications."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom Tor Browser för datorer och Android varken är utformat för eller i "
"praktiken samlar in, behandlar eller lagrar personuppgifter gäller GDPR inte "
"för dessa appar."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"By using Tor Browser for Desktop or Android, or Tor VPN you agree to this "
"policy."
msgstr ""
"Genom att använda Tor Browser för datorer eller Android, eller Tor VPN, "
"godkänner du denna policy."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "Examples of such settings include:"
msgstr "Exempel på sådana inställningar:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"However, users may optionally grant these permissions in specific contexts, "
"such as:"
msgstr ""
"Användare kan dock valfritt bevilja dessa behörigheter i specifika "
"sammanhang, till exempel:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"However, users should be aware of the following cases where some data may "
"persist locally:"
msgstr ""
"Användare bör dock vara medvetna om följande fall där vissa data kan finnas "
"kvar lokalt:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"If you do not agree with this policy, please do not use the applications."
msgstr "Använd inte apparna om du inte godkänner policyn."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"If you have questions about data protection or our privacy practices, you "
"may contact us at: **frontdesk@torproject.org**."
msgstr ""
"Om du har frågor om dataskydd eller våra integritetsrutiner kan du kontakta "
"oss på: **frontdesk@torproject.org**."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"In order to provide user control and customization, Tor VPN stores certain "
"user-configured settings locally on the device."
msgstr ""
"För att ge användaren kontroll och anpassningsmöjligheter lagrar Tor VPN "
"vissa användarkonfigurerade inställningar lokalt på enheten."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"In order to provide user control and ensure privacy-preserving "
"functionality, Tor VPN stores certain user-configured settings locally on "
"the device."
msgstr ""
"För att ge användaren kontroll och säkerställa integritetsskyddande "
"funktionalitet lagrar Tor VPN vissa användarkonfigurerade inställningar "
"lokalt på enheten."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"It explains how each application accesses, collects, uses, and shares user "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Den beskriver hur varje app får åtkomst till, samlar in, använder och delar "
"användardata."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "Material changes will be reflected by:"
msgstr "Väsentliga förändringar kommer att återspeglas genom:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"No permissions are used for telemetry, user tracking, or personal data "
"collection."
msgstr ""
"Inga behörigheter används för telemetri, användarspårning eller insamling av "
"personuppgifter."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"Note: The list of installed apps and protected apps are necessary for the "
"app’s VPN enforcement logic — to guarantee that all apps are routed over Tor "
"unless explicitly exempted by the user."
msgstr ""
"Obs! Listorna över installerade och skyddade appar krävs för appens VPN-"
"logik, så att all apptrafik garanterat dirigeras via Tor om användaren inte "
"uttryckligen har undantagit en app."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "Permissions required:"
msgstr "Behörigheter som krävs:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"The Tor Project is committed to protecting user privacy and supporting the "
"principles of the European Union's General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)."
msgstr ""
"Tor Project har åtagit sig att skydda användarnas integritet och stödja "
"principerna i Europeiska unionens allmänna dataskyddsförordning (GDPR)."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "These apps are **not intended for children under 13**."
msgstr "Dessa appar är **inte avsedda för barn under 13 år**."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"These are limited to what is strictly necessary for VPN operation, user "
"control, and system integration."
msgstr ""
"De är begränsade till vad som är absolut nödvändigt för VPN-drift, "
"användarkontroll och systemintegrering."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "These include:"
msgstr "Dessa omfattar:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"These permissions are **not** related to data collection, and are scoped to "
"support functionality inherited from the Firefox (Fenix) base."
msgstr ""
"Dessa behörigheter är **inte** relaterade till datainsamling och är avsedda "
"att stödja funktioner som ärvts från Firefox (Fenix)-basen."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"These permissions are **not** used to collect, transmit, or share personal "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Dessa behörigheter används **inte** för att samla in, överföra eller dela "
"personuppgifter."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "These preferences:"
msgstr "Dessa inställningar:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"These settings are **never** transmitted to The Tor Project or any third "
"party, and are **not** linked to user identity or device information."
msgstr ""
"Dessa inställningar överförs **aldrig** till The Tor Project eller någon "
"tredje part och kopplas **inte** till användarens identitet eller "
"enhetsinformation."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "These settings:"
msgstr "Dessa inställningar:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "This privacy policy covers:"
msgstr "Denna integritetspolicy omfattar:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser for Android **currently** requires the following permissions:"
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser för Android kräver **för närvarande** följande behörigheter:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "Tor Browser for Android does **not** request access to:"
msgstr "Tor Browser för Android begär **inte** åtkomst till:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "Tor VPN does **not** request access to:"
msgstr "Tor VPN begär **inte** åtkomst till:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"Tor VPN requests the following Android permissions in order to function "
"properly."
msgstr "Tor VPN begär följande Android-behörigheter för att fungera korrekt."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "We design all Tor applications to maximize user privacy and anonymity:"
msgstr ""
"Vi utformar alla Tor-appar för att maximera användarnas integritet och "
"anonymitet:"

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"We do not collect **any** data from anyone. If we learn of such data, it "
"will be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Vi samlar inte in **några** uppgifter från någon. Om vi får kännedom om "
"sådana uppgifter kommer de att raderas."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"We regularly review and audit inherited permissions to ensure they do not "
"compromise user privacy or exposure."
msgstr ""
"Vi granskar och granskar regelbundet ärvda behörigheter för att säkerställa "
"att de inte äventyrar användarnas integritet eller exponering."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid ""
"We routinely audit all permissions to ensure they remain aligned with our "
"privacy-preserving principles."
msgstr ""
"Vi granskar regelbundet alla behörigheter för att säkerställa att de "
"fortsatt överensstämmer med våra integritetsskyddande principer."

#: (content/about/privacy_policy/contents+en.lr:privacy_policy.title) (dynamic)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/privacy_policy/
msgid "Privacy Policy"
msgstr "Integritetspolicy"

#: (content/about/reports/contents+en.lr:reports.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/reports/
msgid ""
"The Tor Project, Inc. is a US 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization committed to "
"transparency in its work and reporting."
msgstr ""
"Tor Project, Inc. är en ideell organisation enligt 501(c)(3) i USA som har "
"åtagit sig att sträva efter transparens i sitt arbete och sin rapportering."

#: (content/about/supporters/contents+en.lr:supporters.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/supporters/
msgid "Having a diverse user base means we have diverse funding sources, too."
msgstr ""
"Att ha en mångfaldig användarbas innebär också att vi har olika "
"finansieringskällor."

#: (content/about/supporters/contents+en.lr:supporters.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/supporters/
msgid "Our goal is to continue diversifying our funding."
msgstr "Vårt mål är att fortsätta diversifiera vår finansiering."

#: (content/about/supporters/contents+en.lr:supporters.body)
#: https://www.torproject.org/about/supporters/
msgid ""
"To inquire about sponsorship, please email [giving@torproject.org]"
"(mailto:giving@torproject.org)"
msgstr ""
"För att fråga om sponsring, mejla [giving@torproject.org]"
"(mailto:giving@torproject.org)"

